/// Verify a presented assertion and decide what happens next.
///
/// `seen_nonce` must atomically record the nonce and report whether it was
/// **already** present. Single use lives there, not here: a MAC cannot know
/// it has been replayed. Returning `true` (already seen) is refused.
///
/// The nonce is recorded *before* the caller mints a session, so a crash
